### Creating a new client via AdminService
POST http://localhost:4004/admin/Customers
Authorization: Basic admin 
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerID": "33333333-3333-3333-3333-333333333333",
  "firstName": "Alex",
  "lastName": "Brown",
  "email": "alex.brown@example.com",
  "phone": "+1987654321",
  "statusCode_code": "Active",
  "averageRating": 0.00
}

### 1. GET - Get a list of all clients
GET http://localhost:4004/admin/Customers
Authorization: Basic admin

###

### 2. GET - Get one specific client by its ID
GET http://localhost:4004/admin/Customers(33333333-3333-3333-3333-333333333333)
Authorization: Basic admin

###

### 3. PATCH - Partial update of client data (for example, phone number and last name have changed)
PATCH http://localhost:4004/admin/Customers(33333333-3333-3333-3333-333333333333)
Authorization: Basic admin
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "lastName": "Brown-Jr",
  "phone": "+79990001122"
}

### 4. POST - Adding the first review for our client (needed for rating test)
POST http://localhost:4004/admin/Feedbacks
Authorization: Basic admin
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "feedbackID": "a1a1a1a1-a1a1-a1a1-a1a1-a1a1a1a1a1a1",
  "rating": 5,
  "comments": "Excellent service and fast delivery!",
  "feedbackDate": "2026-06-13T10:00:00Z",
  "customer_customerID": "33333333-3333-3333-3333-333333333333"
}

###

### 5. POST - Adding a second review for the same client
POST http://localhost:4004/admin/Feedbacks
Authorization: Basic admin
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "feedbackID": "b2b2b2b2-b2b2-b2b2-b2b2-b2b2b2b2b2b2",
  "rating": 3,
  "comments": "The product is fine, but the box was damaged.",
  "feedbackDate": "2026-06-13T12:00:00Z",
  "customer_customerID": "33333333-3333-3333-3333-333333333333"
}

###

### 6. ACTION - Calling a custom action to calculate the average rating
POST http://localhost:4004/admin/calculateAverageRating
Authorization: Basic admin
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerID": "33333333-3333-3333-3333-333333333333"
}

### 7. ACTION - Calling the client status update action
POST http://localhost:4004/admin/updateCustomerStatus
Authorization: Basic admin
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerID": "33333333-3333-3333-3333-333333333333"
}

###

### 8. DELETE - Deleting a client from the database
# Since you have a hard link (Composition) configured, 
# deleting a client will automatically delete all their feedbacks.
DELETE http://localhost:4004/admin/Customers(33333333-3333-3333-3333-333333333333)
Authorization: Basic admin